{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2ecae49a8756ff719836af44fd5f0cca19c8ede903f7fbaf0e09ee675dd86e30", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんっ！\nお帰りなさい、お待ちしてました♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n欢迎回来，我在等你呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5de6bb86991de629ba16dfeb4ea48fc2bc72d605bb0753fdb8b3dba034a06836", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n何か用事ですか？", "zh": "辛苦你了，青羽小姐。\n有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "f929c396abf9e1443bb5c268b56a5ce0a827c0a6e99a4bbec321fb8e4a2208be", "ja": "はい！　実は今度、みんなでピクニック……\nじゃなくて！　いいニュースがあるんですっ。", "zh": "是的！其实是下次我想找大家一起野餐……\n不对！是有一个好消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "d8090613afc3fa6367562a275454bfec82bad9fb72d6dc8654b982701edcf9c6", "ja": "{$P$}さんが社長さんに出した、\n新ユニットの企画が、通ったみたいですよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生交给社长的新团体企划案，\n似乎通过了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ae53cb22152d76cd1dc0d7cefb0c275ba4e6eae9f33b514948ec28306781a0fd", "ja": "えっ！？　本当ですか！", "zh": "咦！？真的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ca19626c038150fd90ad57406e86be5499f6bb795f97606b0550708a50fe1bb0", "ja": "ええ♪　社長さん、とっても楽しそうでした。\nすごく面白い企画になりそうだって。", "zh": "是啊♪社长他好像非常期待，\n说看起来会是非常有趣的企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "87c870576b1fc9daf743851481d643337e99449f0aaba00f60604c8a9074d6de", "ja": "そうですか……じゃあ俺は、さっそく\n事務所に行ってきます。留守をお願いしますね！", "zh": "这样啊……那我马上去一趟事务所，\n麻烦你顾一下这里了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "4cf98114b13ce0dc80e83034b840fef1361c8f7ff2968a4bf834134159e326ed", "ja": "はーい♪\n{$P$}さん、いってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "好的～♪\n{$P$}先生，请慢走～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a265820cb939f1bbd35957964cee95c3cacbcb96313711da644b04d4141048c4", "ja": "社長、音無さん！　お疲れさまで……。", "zh": "社长、音无小姐！辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "141bd5bc476dfb2951a4808998cf63fc94402b4d49a397274ab3e6db417ea056", "ja": "シーッ！！！", "zh": "嘘──！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8e04315ab6b55dfadc8333baa62e46cc8b0f067fd73fd6324ad4f172568f8e6a", "ja": "！？\nど、どうしたんですか社長……あっ。", "zh": "！？\n怎、怎么了吗，社长……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "a097a4ca7f71ea7aec73fc3259afe5068f26d8b8c2cbb018cb6abcef782ac98a", "ja": "すぅ……すぅ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "06b4b88f1a9082766286b47525a4a79c76b7054cd49258afe4e4d5ee2440b6cf", "ja": "すまない。ご覧の通りなんだ……\n君を待つ間、音無君が疲れて寝てしまってね。", "zh": "抱歉，正如你所见……\n在等你的期间，音无累到睡着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "c1d44605a51238ba270ecd8e50806ad99b38200cd0d8f6dfc5878d1028e15126", "ja": "ここしばらく、忙しくて無理をしてもらったからね。\nもう少し、寝かせてあげようと思っているんだよ。", "zh": "最近一段时间太忙，把她累坏了，\n所以我想让她再小睡一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5a0bf05567cda6887456a625cd0e3895d86335ca2ecec477fe168ae303f08bbb", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました。では、小声で……。\n青羽さんから、新ユニット案が通ったと聞きました。", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了，那我说话小声点……\n我听青羽小姐说，新团体提案已经通过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "bfa6ed22b37bf27a5ce24a9aece4ce8c2cce0a58e4aea130c5d65d434a0e6a8f", "ja": "うむ、そうなんだよ！\n実に素晴らしいユニットじゃないかね、君！", "zh": "嗯，没错！\n那实在是很棒的团体，真有你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "2631b7832c6aeb2144e54ebadd38b010bc85a7bbe92455f37656e7dfe2db28e3", "ja": "う、うぅん……？", "zh": "唔、唔唔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d14e169a946ec3927e21b58b37b76568e9039016409344938f3322df670a44d6", "ja": "しゃ、社長、シーッ！\n大きな声を出したら、音無さんが……。", "zh": "社、社长，嘘──！\n太大声的话，音无小姐会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "22019d39f58613e4f34adf1ce34393bf95c06cab94d34e6c46665b459cbba2ff", "ja": "おっと！　いかんいかん、つい興奮してしまった……。\nとにかく、このユニット案には私もピン！ときたよ。", "zh": "哎呀！糟糕糟糕，一不小心太兴奋了……\n总之，这次的团体提案也让我觉得「就是它了」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "64439aab96a9f6547d2323621a55527dbd1a43a52a7cca5d57a40adc5df2871f", "ja": "北沢志保君、白石紬君、\nそして真壁瑞希君を加えたトリオ編成……。", "zh": "北泽志保、白石䌷，\n再加上真壁瑞希组成三人组……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "768cfb93cea273b0630d9f81722098e701754a2ea1431886224766ab3c6b8bc8", "ja": "いや、実に素晴らしい！　彼女達のステージを\n想像するだけで楽しみだよ！　ハハハ……！", "zh": "哎呀，实在是太棒了！\n光是想像她们的表演就让我很期待！哈哈哈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_1022", "source_sha256": "5fe4875e541cec22dc8e78ebfd44cf8db6016af8892e13ac15af543c909007f0", "ja": "シーッ！", "zh": "嘘──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8929b7762b9fefea7b052c24397f3646e8eb58d6f65bd9c8b22da686b9e30cb9", "ja": "社長、シーッ！", "zh": "社长，嘘──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142", "ja": "あっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "727bf4a60fa5b33f6f8300d1a985849ada101332f2c84aca42cd0a3fa9d543a6", "ja": "う、う～ん……。\nあ、あれ？　社長に……{$P$}さん？", "zh": "唔、唔～嗯……奇、奇怪？\n社长……还有{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "895c71263b7bf59bef85c9c63dd648f43d4dff919ec3b6293c134f203254d9ee", "ja": "おお、しまった……！\nすまないね音無君、起こしてしまった。", "zh": "哦哦，糟糕……！\n抱歉呀，音无，把你给吵醒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "25d74c98117010829beb519d5fff574dd7d866d46de26f775c7d3ab4bc89e9bc", "ja": "えっ……わ、私ったら、寝ちゃってたんですか！？\nもう、社長！　すぐに起こしてくださらないと……！", "zh": "咦……我、我真是的，居然睡着了吗！？\n哎唷，社长！你应该马上叫醒我的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2005_101kot", "source_sha256": "99bf0aed395b8a1a311749d82b716084c8c12bccf3cdcb17f3ecd16bf59fbf28", "ja": "うぅっ……{$P$}さんに、\n寝顔を見られてしまっただなんて……。", "zh": "呜呜……居然被{$P$}先生\n看见我睡着的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "e121176e0a155c6a539fa891cf1634e5f6e0cc8c943f3a97cca69b210031a55a", "ja": "ははは、音無君、実に初々しい反応だね。\nなんだか高校生の頃の君を思い出すよ……。", "zh": "哈哈哈，音无这个反应真是青涩，\n让人依稀回想起高中时的你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2007_101kot", "source_sha256": "a7223b0a5391d7049c508050310d2bd64d1fc3437b3c65c622df778c0115c146", "ja": "社長……？", "zh": "社长……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2008_president", "source_sha256": "1dd43e0938eb0aeffd53faeb77c92e1767a029ae96377fdfac7957ef2f3f5473", "ja": "おっと……おっほん！\nとにかく、君、新ユニット企画は任せたよ！", "zh": "哎呀……咳咳！\n总之，新团体企划就交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2009_p", "source_sha256": "9414d9e5b68340870cf14f77f29addecac975d9424f2c9c5f65c41a884957100", "ja": "はい！　早速、準備に取り掛かります。", "zh": "是！我会立刻着手准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2010_president", "source_sha256": "a8aac10dca86eacc5437ed6e5fac346addec85b2f837e24f82bfb6e33e361cc4", "ja": "うむ。それと、これは私からの提案なのだが……。\n今回は、新しい事に挑戦してみないかね？", "zh": "嗯。另外，我有一个提议……\n这次要不要尝试看看新挑战啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2011_p", "source_sha256": "af7d356038ba896689bedc889dea223278540fbe9b530934306d6f4ba6b44a22", "ja": "新しい事……と言いますと？", "zh": "新挑战……社长的意思是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2012_president", "source_sha256": "30304d735bb4db7c26c6927cd676b16410d1f2af81e38c0e4cf969a4e1b4e33f", "ja": "ズバリ、物語風のロングPVを撮るんだ。\nどうだね、新しい試みだろう？", "zh": "那就是，拍摄有故事性的长篇PV。\n怎么样？算是一种新尝试吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2013_p", "source_sha256": "e4266db6d7dcb7cc13258465822e7bf177db7e51eea9f792edc8cdccc8415273", "ja": "物語風のロングPV……！\n是非やってみたいですが、いいんですか？", "zh": "有故事性的长篇PV……！\n我非常想试试看，真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2014_president", "source_sha256": "97a557801a3dbff4c9500105bcec400d6adda92344dff1570ac2d765f631945d", "ja": "もちろんだよ！　最近は劇場の運営も好調だし、\nちょっと張り込んでみようじゃないか。", "zh": "当然可以！反正最近剧场经营得很顺利，\n就稍微砸点钱去做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2015_101kot", "source_sha256": "21bc14c03e9560108ed865033199ea2139aabc7d0a32e268e2931b364621f396", "ja": "社長、今回はかなり奮発するつもりだって\n言ってましたもんね。", "zh": "社长说过，这次打算要大手笔砸重金呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2016_president", "source_sha256": "99ae174dcb48a445debd19c2a145ee612163967bb925253a42677a303d47c64a", "ja": "うむ！　しばらく私のお昼ご飯は、お茶漬けオンリーに\nなりそうだがね。はっはっはっ……。", "zh": "没错！虽然我的午餐似乎暂时只能吃茶泡饭了。\n哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2017_101kot", "source_sha256": "6bc7cb8ded0f319854de7e65b9c54e5af30b2f79b2da53e05b373087b3f600b2", "ja": "社長……私のお弁当のおかずでよかったら、\nわけて差し上げますね……。", "zh": "社长……要是不嫌弃我的便当配菜，\n到时候请分一点去吃吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0029_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0029_story_intro_2018_p", "source_sha256": "637f7a44d7f2660232fe14fb16d8aa1d5df164a1df75812fbc6b3a4f89620d11", "ja": "（社長が、食費を削ってまで用意してくれた機会……\n必ず成功させてみせるぞ！）", "zh": "（社长为了给我这个机会，甚至还削减伙食费……\n我一定要做好这个企划！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
